OL,3,GNEWSANature reserve fire spreads across
OL,4,Aseven hectares
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling flare-ups
OL,7,Ffrom a heathland fire at a nature
OL,8,Freserve that covers about seven
OL,9,Fhectares (17 acres).
OL,11,FThe blaze on Canford Heath near Poole
OL,12,Fbroke out on Wednesday at about 20:00
OL,13,FGMT with about 45 firefighters from
OL,14,Facross Dorset and Hampshire initially
OL,15,Fsent in 14 firefighting appliances.
OL,17,FDorset & Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,18,FService said flames had spread rapidly
OL,19,Fdue to high winds. It said crews in
OL,20,Fnumerous off-road appliances, along
OL,21,Fwith a drone, were working to manage
OL,22,Fflare-ups and hotspots.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
